      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "私のように、箒を持った女性が、あと２人います。\n上層や下層には行っていないはず……\n彼女たちを探し出して、『目標は達した』\nと伝えてもらえませんか？　御願いします！",
        "official_en": "There's two other women with brooms somewhere in\nDagsion. Could you find them and tell them \"the goal\nhas been achieved\"? Oh! If it helps, they shouldn't\nbe in hightown or lowtown! Thanks a bunch!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
